2023-06-16 15:42:26.146 [http-nio-2082-exec-7] INFO  c.a.r.d.controller.JobController:76 - [fid:LRZ2QKBEA1FYJG4G3O8S] responseEntity : {"headers":{},"body":{"requestId":"cl59hmtox2","requestDate":"2023-06-16T22:42:21.481000","responseId":"cl59hmtox2-9OQRHYLKU9","responseDate":"2023-06-16T15:42:26.122484","status":null,"error":null,"message":"OK","httpStatus":"OK","lstTbJob":[{"tbjId":6,"tbjCreateDate":1683970026000,"tbjCreateId":28,"tbjName":"Song Writer","tbjStatus":"active","tbjUpdateDate":1683970055000,"tbjUpdateId":28,"tbjCreateIdc":1,"tbjUuid":"D0LE7","tbdId":null,"tbjAssigned":null,"tbjDescription":"Job Title: Song Writer\n\nJob Summary:\n\nWe are looking for an experienced and creative Song Writer to join our team. The Song Writer will be responsible for writing original music and lyrics for our projects. The ideal candidate should have a strong understanding of music theory and be able to create unique and engaging songs.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n Write original music and lyrics for our projects\n\n Collaborate with other songwriters and producers to create unique and engaging songs\n\n Research and develop new musical ideas\n\n Record and produce demos of songs\n\n Participate in songwriting sessions\n\n Ensure all songs are completed on time and within budget\n\n Maintain a high level of creativity and quality\n\n Stay up to date with industry trends\n\nRequirements:\n\n Bachelors degree in Music or related field\n\n Proven experience as a songwriter\n\n Excellent knowledge of music theory\n\n Ability to work independently and collaboratively\n\n Excellent communication and interpersonal skills\n\n Proficient in music production software\n\n Ability to work under pressure and meet deadlines\n\n Passion for music and creativity","tbjResumeStatus":"Scheduling Interview, HR Interview, Hiring Manager Interview, Technical Test, Offer"},{"tbjId":7,"tbjCreateDate":1683972183000,"tbjCreateId":28,"tbjName":"Chef","tbjStatus":"active","tbjUpdateDate":1684041908000,"tbjUpdateId":28,"tbjCreateIdc":1,"tbjUuid":"13QR0","tbdId":null,"tbjAssigned":null,"tbjDescription":"\n\nJob Title: Chef\n\nJob Summary:\n\nWe are looking for an experienced and creative Chef to join our team. The Chef will be responsible for creating and preparing delicious meals for our customers. The Chef will be expected to have a strong knowledge of food preparation and presentation techniques, as well as a passion for creating unique and flavorful dishes.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n Create and prepare delicious meals for customers\n Develop and maintain menus that are creative and appealing\n Ensure that all food is prepared in accordance with health and safety regulations\n Monitor food inventory and order supplies as needed\n Train and supervise kitchen staff\n Maintain a clean and organized kitchen\n Monitor food costs and portion control\n Develop and implement new recipes\n\nQualifications:\n\n Proven experience as a Chef\n Knowledge of food preparation and presentation techniques\n Ability to work in a fast-paced environment\n Excellent organizational and time management skills\n Ability to work independently and as part of a team\n Knowledge of health and safety regulations\n Culinary school degree or equivalent experience","tbjResumeStatus":"Scheduling Interview, HR Interview, Hiring Manager Interview, Technical Test, Offer"},{"tbjId":8,"tbjCreateDate":1684135496000,"tbjCreateId":28,"tbjName":"Sales Associate","tbjStatus":"active","tbjUpdateDate":1686415857000,"tbjUpdateId":28,"tbjCreateIdc":1,"tbjUuid":"90N8D","tbdId":12,"tbjAssigned":"assigned","tbjDescription":"Sales Associate\n\nJob Summary:\n\nWe are looking for an experienced and motivated Sales Associate to join our team. The Sales Associate will be responsible for providing excellent customer service, building relationships with customers, and helping to drive sales. The ideal candidate will have excellent communication and interpersonal skills, be highly organized, and have a strong understanding of sales principles.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n Greet customers and provide excellent customer service\n Assist customers in selecting products that meet their needs\n Answer customer questions and provide product information\n Process sales transactions accurately and efficiently\n Maintain a clean and organized sales floor\n Assist in maintaining inventory levels\n Assist in merchandising and display setup\n Participate in store promotions and events\n Follow all company policies and procedures\n\nRequirements:\n\n High school diploma or equivalent\n Previous retail sales experience preferred\n Excellent communication and interpersonal skills\n Ability to work independently and as part of a team\n Ability to stand for long periods of time\n Ability to lift up to 25 lbs.\n\nIf you are interested in this position, please submit your resume and cover letter for consideration. We look forward to hearing from you!","tbjResumeStatus":"Scheduling Interview, HR Interview, Hiring Manager Interview, Technical Test, Offer, Onboard"}],"length":8},"statusCodeValue":200,"statusCode":"OK"}
